    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_11#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_11",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Halt, stalker. You can't go any further!",
      "JA_current": "止まれ、ストーカー！ ここから先は立ち入り禁止だ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "11",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_33#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 78,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_33",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Say \"hi\" for the Barkeep from me when you see him. Oh, and don't forget - there are lots of anomalies on the way, so be careful.",
      "JA_current": "バーキープに会ったら、俺からもよろしく言っておいてくれ。それと……この先はアノマリーだらけだから、気を抜くなよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "33",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 6,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Why?",
      "JA_current": "なぜ通れないんだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_1111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 9,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_1111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Because that's our territory - Duty territory; and we're very picky about who we let through into our base. If you don't have anything important to discuss with our leaders you ain't getting past here for free.",
      "JA_current": "ここはデューティーの縄張りだ。部外者を勝手に基地へ通すわけにはいかん。司令部に極めて重要な用件でもあるなら別だがな。タダで通れると思うなよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "1111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_11111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 12,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_11111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I see. And how much is it to pass?",
      "JA_current": "なるほど。なら、通行料はいくらだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "11111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_11112#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 18,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_11112",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I need to pass, I have some business with the Barkeep.",
      "JA_current": "通してくれ。バーキープに用があるんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "11112",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_111111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 15,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_111111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, regarding the fact that we see you for the first time - you may be some killer, or something... Mmm... Let's say - a hundred grand.",
      "JA_current": "そうだな、見ねえ顔だし、どこの回し者か殺し屋かも分からんからな……10万ルーブルってところだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "111111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_111121#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 21,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_111121",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yes, Barkeep told us about you. You can pass.",
      "JA_current": "ああ、バーキープから話は聞いている。通っていいぞ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "111121",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_1111211#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 24,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_1111211",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I'd rather pay. Here.",
      "JA_current": "金なら払う。ほらよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "1111211",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_111122#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 51,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_111122",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I don't have the money.",
      "JA_current": "そんな大金、持ち合わせてない。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "111122",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dolg_blokpost_11112111x1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 30,
      "string_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost_11112111x1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Good! You can go. Be careful - there's lots of anomalies ahead.",
      "JA_current": "よし、通れ。だが用心しろよ……この先はアノマリーだらけだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dolg_blokpost",
          "phrase_id": "1111211199",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
